[00:00.00] 作词 : Rick Nowels/Darren Hayes
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Rick Nowels/Darren Hayes
[00:34.58]Creepin' up on you is the wrong thing to do (情不自禁爱上你是错的事情)
[00:38.15]
[00:38.65]I found your address got your phone number too (我发现了你的住址，也知道了你的手机号码)
[00:42.88]
[00:43.17]Visit all the stores where you buy all your clothes (我寻访了你买衣服的所有商店)
[00:47.32]
[00:47.50]Been to secret places you think nobody knows (甚至那些你认为没人知道的秘密之地)
[00:51.71]
[00:52.43]If I have to live without you (如果我不得不没有你活下去)
[00:55.26]
[00:55.41]Nobody could...... (没有人可以)
[00:56.84]
[00:56.99]I need to be around you (我需要一直陪在你身边)
[00:59.64]
[00:59.83]Watchin' you (看着你)
[01:00.82]
[01:01.40]No one else can love you like I do (没有人可以像我这样爱你)
[01:05.61]
[01:05.79]Feel it when I'm creepin' up on you (当我情不自禁爱上你的时候，我感觉到了这些)
[01:10.13]
[01:10.28]I know that it wouldn't be right (我知道这不是正确的)
[01:13.46]
[01:13.61]If I stayed all night (如果我停留整个夜晚)
[01:14.77]
[01:15.62]Just to peek in on you (只是一直偷看看着你)
[01:17.85]
[01:18.04]Creepin' up on you.. (情不自禁爱上你)
[01:20.27]
[01:28.38]I been hanging round all the places you haunt (我曾经徘徊在你经过的所有地方)
[01:32.28]
[01:32.44]Spying on your friends to find out what you want (向你的朋友们打探你喜欢想要什么)
[01:36.51]
[01:36.72]Drinking from the glass that you left on the bar (饮尽了你留在酒吧玻璃杯的半杯残酒)
[01:41.24]
[01:41.40]Follow you around driving home in your car... (尾随在你身边直到你开车回家)
[01:45.62]
[01:46.12]Do I have to breathe without you? (我不得不没有你活下去吗？)
[01:48.95]
[01:49.14]Coz nobody could (因为没有人能)
[01:50.58]
[01:50.76]I need to be around you (我需要在你身边)
[01:53.29]
[01:53.47]Watching you (看着你)
[01:54.70]
[01:54.85]No one else can love you like I do (没有人能像我那么爱你)
[01:59.03]
[01:59.18]Feel it when I'm creepin' up on you (当我情不自禁爱上你的时候，我感觉到了这些)
